  message: "Filed while verifying LIVE.md's roster claims at session start. Reproduced live this session: a 13-ID status sweep piping stdout to a JSON parser returned 13 false UNRESOLVED, because argparse wrote its usage error to stderr and my loop had 2>/dev/null. Same symptom the prior session attributed to a wrong cwd -- both causes produce empty stdout, so the earlier diagnosis may have been the other half of the same hazard. Marked not-duplicate-of WI-vokiz (SimHash 8 bits, but that item is tree_sitter Node.text guarding -- unrelated)."  # 738a
